## Scenarios

### builtin min/max/abs (bare-function form)

#### min returns the smaller of two ints, either order

- Verify: min returns the smaller of two ints, either order


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: min returns the smaller of two ints, either order")
assert_equal(min(3, 7), 3)
assert_equal(min(7, 3), 3)
```

</details>

